{"id":"3987a9cfc50008a9","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-consistent-extension.md","title":"GL Consistent Extension","display":"df-gl-consistent-extension — GL Consistent Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-consistent-extension","aliases":["89-df-gl-consistent-extension"],"display":"df-gl-consistent-extension — GL Consistent Extension","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-extension]]","[[89-df-gl-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-consistent-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-consistent-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-consistent-extension — GL Consistent Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40b00bc10cced0e5\" href=\"?note=40b00bc10cced0e5\" title=\"89-df-gl-extension\">89-df-gl-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e4d04822974c002\" href=\"?note=0e4d04822974c002\" title=\"89-df-gl-consistency\">89-df-gl-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40b00bc10cced0e5\" href=\"?note=40b00bc10cced0e5\" title=\"89-df-gl-extension\">89-df-gl-extension</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元一致扩张谓词，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\land\\bot\\notin S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\land\\bot\\notin S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL的一致扩展保持一致性</li>\n<li>GL的一致扩展不能证明矛盾</li>\n<li>GL的一致扩展用于模型构造</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-extension","status":"resolved","id":"40b00bc10cced0e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"0e4d04822974c002","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-extension","status":"resolved","id":"40b00bc10cced0e5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-gl-extension]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\land\\bot\\notin S.","display":true}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 6 章，印刷页 85–87；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n局部一致性允许必然化 $L$ 的定理，但不允许把 $\\Gamma$ 中的世界假设任意必然化。$\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\varnothing)$ 等价于 $\\bot\\notin L$。MCS 对 MP 闭合、包含 $L$ 且不含 $\\bot$；每个 $A$ 恰含 $A,\\neg A$ 之一。此接口不同于 [[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]] 的公理扩张一致性。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-consistent-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["40b00bc10cced0e5","0e4d04822974c002"]}